{"id":"poka","lemma":"пока","pos":"adv","rank":73,"glosses":["for the present, for the time being","for now (at the moment; until later)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f4/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я пока здесь.","en":"I'm here for now.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Пока что достаточно.","en":"That's enough for now.","words":[null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"enough, sufficiently"}]},{"text":"Пока всё хорошо.","en":"It's all right for now.","words":[null,{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"well, right"}]},{"text":"Пока этого будет достаточно.","en":"That will be enough for the time being.","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"enough, sufficiently"}]},{"text":"Что мне пока делать?","en":"What should I do in the meantime?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"to make, to do"}]}]}